note compiler-pin=omega-bridge/0fc7d8662cb799e7c206b17c18ea4c3ec2b8fea9; compiler-sha256=191b776ef98821597c3e30655da6d680a9b66edbc9ceaca3c39c61ea6df098e9.
note Independent expected values: max+1=0; 0-1=max; max*2=max-1; max/3=6148914691236517205.
